{
  "id":"set_2","title":"LEFT JOIN Lab / LEFT JOIN 實驗室","description":"Connect SW_POKE with POKEMON using LEFT JOIN. / 使用 LEFT JOIN 連接 SW_POKE 與 POKEMON。",
  "datasets":{
